            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "abbypj"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe is extremely easy to make, and my guests loved it!! Between four of us, we finished the whole thing! I did take the advice and doubled the brown sugar and added 1/2 tablespoon of almond extract to the cherry filling. Served with homemade whipped cream and it was perfect!",
