              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Amanda Chisholm"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this as written. Way to much flour and topping altogether. Not enough cherry filling. Use 2 cans of filling for a deep dish pie. Won't make this again. I can tinker and make my own crumb topping, like for a dutch apple pie, without following this recipe. For anyone following an actual recipe and wanting it to turn out, look elsewhere.",
