              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lynn Brynildsen-Hirsch"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a really good cherry pie! I didn't have sliced almonds handy, so I substitute slivered ones and we all loved it. It made the topping nice and crunchy. I never made a cherry pie with cinnamon mixed in with the filling, and I would do that again in a heartbeat. It cut the sweetness down a little and gave it an earthy sort of taste.",
